    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you identify dangers and near-miss situations in various locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have recently been appointed as the <strong>Chairperson of the Safety and Health Committee</strong> at your workplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new chairperson, it is your responsibility to learn about various near-miss incidents and potential hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of your training, you will enter a <strong>virtual world created with digital twin technology</strong>, which closely replicates the real world.<br>In this simulation, avatars will engage in dangerous behaviors, and your mission is to identify and point out those hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect manuals</strong> that describe the safety rules for each location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find an avatar engaging in dangerous behavior or breaking the rules, <strong>confront them by presenting the manual</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the avatar is in a safe state, confirm it with a cheerful &quot;<strong>Safety Check! (Yoshi!)</strong>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work isn\u2019t done until you return safely.<br>There is also a <strong>time limit</strong>, so try to complete your tasks efficiently and reach the goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The images shown are from a development version and may be subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you identify dangers and near-miss situations in various locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have recently been appointed as the <strong>Chairperson of the Safety and Health Committee</strong> at your workplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new chairperson, it is your responsibility to learn about various near-miss incidents and potential hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of your training, you will enter a <strong>virtual world created with digital twin technology</strong>, which closely replicates the real world.<br>In this simulation, avatars will engage in dangerous behaviors, and your mission is to identify and point out those hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect manuals</strong> that describe the safety rules for each location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find an avatar engaging in dangerous behavior or breaking the rules, <strong>confront them by presenting the manual</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the avatar is in a safe state, confirm it with a cheerful &quot;<strong>Safety Check! (Yoshi!)</strong>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work isn\u2019t done until you return safely.<br>There is also a <strong>time limit</strong>, so try to complete your tasks efficiently and reach the goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The images shown are from a development version and may be subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
